        "At a church Christmas party, Waverly receives Life Savers, Winston receives a model submarine, and Vincent receives a used chess set with missing pieces.",
        "Waverly uses her Life Savers to persuade her brothers to let her play chess. This already shows her ability to use strategy.",
        "Waverly asks many questions about the rules. Her mother compares chess rules to American rules that immigrants must learn in order to survive and succeed.",
